{"id":"96be027f863914f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-easton-complete.md","title":"Easton Completeness","display":"thm-easton-complete — Easton Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-easton-complete","aliases":["58-thm-easton-complete"],"display":"thm-easton-complete — Easton Completeness","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-easton.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-easton-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-easton-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-easton-complete — Easton Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08163b61fc3df1a5\" href=\"?note=08163b61fc3df1a5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-easton.md\">../batch19/58-df-easton.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (set-sized Easton function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08163b61fc3df1a5\" href=\"?note=08163b61fc3df1a5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-easton.md\">../batch19/58-df-easton.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Easton}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\)</span> (Easton-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08163b61fc3df1a5\" href=\"?note=08163b61fc3df1a5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-easton.md\">../batch19/58-df-easton.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalitiesPreserved}\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalitiesPreserved}\\)</span> (forcing-language sentence) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (ambient-universe forcing relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}easton\\text{-}complete} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Easton}_S(F,D)\\to\\exists \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\left(\\mathrm{CofinalitiesPreserved}\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in\\check D\\;\\left(2^\\kappa=\\check F(\\kappa)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}easton\\text{-}complete} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Easton}_S(F,D)\\to\\exists \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\left(\\mathrm{CofinalitiesPreserved}\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in\\check D\\;\\left(2^\\kappa=\\check F(\\kappa)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Easton forcing realizes the prescribed continuum function at regular cardinals while preserving cofinalities.</li>\n<li>No value at a singular cardinal is asserted by this theorem. Forcing over the ambient universe is explicitly metatheoretic; it is not the set-ground-model relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P}\\)</span> with an omitted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-easton.md","status":"resolved","id":"08163b61fc3df1a5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-easton.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-easton.md","status":"resolved","id":"08163b61fc3df1a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ (set-sized Easton function on $D$, see [[../batch19/58-df-easton.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-easton.md","status":"resolved","id":"08163b61fc3df1a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Easton}_S$ (Easton-function predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-easton.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":fal